:Apply UpdateDataSafePrivateEndpoint only for\nmutable fields displayName, description,\nnsgIds, freeformTags (+1 more);
else (no)
:Skip the no-op mutation path;
endif
:Run provider helper hooks\ncreate=generatedruntime.Create\nentity=DataSafePrivateEndpoint\naction=CREATE_PRIVATE_ENDPOINT;\nupdate=generatedruntime.Update\nentity=DataSafePrivateEndpoint\naction=UPDATE_PRIVATE_ENDPOINT;\ndelete=generatedruntime.Delete\nentity=DataSafePrivateEndpoint\naction=DELETE_PRIVATE_ENDPOINT when the\nmatching field-driven path executes;
:Apply explicit follow-up semantics\ncreate=GetWorkRequest ->\nGetDataSafePrivateEndpoint;\nupdate=GetWorkRequest ->\nGetDataSafePrivateEndpoint;\ndelete=confirm-delete;
:Return success for the ACTIVE success state;
:Project required status and finalizer policy\nretain-until-confirmed-delete;
:Requeue on provisioning, updating, terminating;
}
endif
